===Alternative forms===
* [[Cadien]] (Louisiana French orthography), {{l|en|Cajin}}, {{l|en|Cadjin}}, {{l|en|Cagin}} (obsolete)

===Etymology===
An Anglicization of the {{der|en|fr-aca|Cadien}} (itself an {{l|en|aphesis|aphetic}} form of {{m|fr|Acadien||{{l|en|Acadian}}}}), reflecting the palatalization of {{IPAchar|/dj/}} to {{IPAchar|/d͡ʒ/}} in the Acadian dialect.

